 Creek there's potential for cost savings as you talked about.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/08/pan-american-silver-corp-paas-q3-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"PAAS 2019 Q3","e":"paas","d":"2019-11-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Steinmann","x":"Given that cost performance was better than expected and higher gold price assumptions we have lowered our annual guidance for 2019 consolidated silver basis cash costs to between negative $5.50 to negative $3.80 per silver ounce and all-in sustaining costs to between $6 and $7.50 per silver ounce.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/08/pan-american-silver-corp-paas-q3-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"PAAS 2019 Q4","e":"paas","d":"2020-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Steinmann","x":"Sorry, you've probably also seen that as a -- quite a few other changes there is a double severance payment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/pan-american-silver-corp-paas-q4-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"PAAS 2020 Q1","e":"paas","d":"2020-05-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Steinmann","x":"But I'll pass it on to Chris Emerson to give you more details on that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/pan-american-silver-corp-paas-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"PAAS 2020 Q1","e":"paas","d":"2020-05-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Steinmann","x":"Given the level of uncertainty regarding a ramp-up to normal operations in Q1, we withdrew our guidance in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/pan-american-silver-corp-paas-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"PAAS 2020 Q2","e":"paas","d":"2020-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Steinmann","x":"So I may be pass it on to Steve for his comments, but I don't think that we see dramatic increases yet.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/pan-american-silver-paas-q2-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"PAAS 2020 Q2","e":"paas","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Steinmann","x":"A reduced workforce is conducting care and maintenance activities at those mines until it is determined that normal operations can safely resume.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/pan-american-silver-paas-q2-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"PAAS 2020 Q2","e":"paas","d":"2020-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Steinmann","x":"We withdrew the guidance previously provided for 2020 because we were unable to determine the impact from the government-mandated suspensions at that time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/pan-american-silver-paas-q2-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"PAAS 2020 Q3","e":"paas","d":"2020-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steve Busby","x":"The real impact was just not getting enough workforce deployed to do the work, passing through the protocols, passing our screening to get to the site.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/pan-american-silver-paas-q3-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"PAAS 2020 Q3","e":"paas","d":"2020-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steve Busby","x":"The uncertainty comes in how many of our workforce actually pass through the screen, and that depends on the outbreaks in the region in and around our mine sites.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/pan-american-silver-paas-q3-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"PAAS 2020 Q3","e":"paas","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Steinmann","x":"That means we are operating with a reduced workforce, and operations are running below full capacities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/pan-american-silver-paas-q3-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"PAAS 2020 Q4","e":"paas","d":"2021-02-18","l":"pricing_power